* amdgpu (driver/graphics/amdgpu): settings for every GPU the driver binds
* (the file is read for the module, not per GPU).
* Runtime PM and ASPM stay off until they are tested on illumos.
* HDMI/DP audio is left at the driver's default (auto): with amdgpu_audio = 0
* the DCE 6 display code (Southern Islands) sets up no audio pins and the
* monitor gets no sound. Display Core (Polaris) programs stream audio either
* way; HDMI/DP audio is untested there.
* Power management (dpm) is on, the driver's default, tested on Polaris 11
* (MacBook Pro 15-inch 2017) 2026-11-19: SMU7 powerplay up, 4K60 H.264 decode
* and playback, no errors.
set amdgpu:amdgpu_runtime_pm = 0
set amdgpu:amdgpu_aspm = 0
